WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.201
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.201 --> 00:00:03.203
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.203 --> 00:00:04.336
We hope you're doing well
tonight.

00:00:04.336 --> 00:00:05.671
And now we're going
to get to the news.

00:00:05.671 --> 00:00:08.507
Judge Ketanji Brown Jackson
today became the first

00:00:08.507 --> 00:00:10.843
Black woman to be confirmed
to the Supreme Court,

00:00:10.843 --> 00:00:12.244
in case you're wondering

00:00:12.244 --> 00:00:15.415
why the flag over the Fox News
building is at half staff.

00:00:15.415 --> 00:00:16.850
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:19.118
That's right,
Judge Ketanji Brown Jackson

00:00:19.118 --> 00:00:21.620
today became the first
Black woman to be confirmed

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:22.956
to the Supreme Court.

00:00:22.956 --> 00:00:24.791
And I can't believe
I have to say this --

00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:28.294
Brett, that champagne
was for everyone.

00:00:28.294 --> 00:00:31.430
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.430 --> 00:00:33.266
In a speech
at a union conference,

00:00:33.266 --> 00:00:35.334
President Biden joked that
he had forgotten the name

00:00:35.334 --> 00:00:37.503
of former President Trump
and said,

00:00:37.503 --> 00:00:39.839
"That last guy, what was
his name, anyway?

00:00:39.839 --> 00:00:41.841
He never showed up
in the inauguration.

00:00:41.841 --> 00:00:45.512
Though, to be fair, it's not
like we showed up to his."

00:00:45.512 --> 00:00:47.981
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.981 --> 00:00:50.416
Former President Trump yesterday
officially endorsed

00:00:50.416 --> 00:00:52.551
Georgia Congresswoman
Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:00:52.551 --> 00:00:54.220
for re-election and said she is

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:57.223
"a warrior who doesn't back down
and doesn't give up."

00:00:57.223 --> 00:00:59.224
Basically, all the same reasons

00:00:59.224 --> 00:01:01.227
she's banned from Target.

00:01:01.227 --> 00:01:03.196
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.196 --> 00:01:05.198
NBC News staffers
are reportedly worried

00:01:05.198 --> 00:01:06.632
that the company's decision
to hire

00:01:06.632 --> 00:01:09.002
White House Press Secretary
Jen Psaki

00:01:09.002 --> 00:01:12.672
to host a show on MSNBC could
taint the network's credibility.

00:01:12.672 --> 00:01:14.006
Meanwhile, Fox News

00:01:14.006 --> 00:01:15.975
is almost entirely taints.

00:01:15.975 --> 00:01:17.843
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.843 --> 00:01:19.512
According to a new survey,

00:01:19.512 --> 00:01:21.613
Ukrainian President
Volodymyr Zelenskyy

00:01:21.613 --> 00:01:24.784
is the world's most popular
leader among Americans.

00:01:24.784 --> 00:01:26.953
But, remember, Volodymyr,
two weeks ago,

00:01:26.953 --> 00:01:29.622
Will Smith was our most popular
movie star.

00:01:29.622 --> 00:01:32.959
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.959 --> 00:01:36.295
Pinterest announced yesterday
that it will prohibit users

00:01:36.295 --> 00:01:39.131
from sharing climate
misinformation on the platform,

00:01:39.131 --> 00:01:41.634
forcing them to move to Etsy.

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:43.203
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.238 --> 00:01:48.408
And, finally,
NASA announced this week

00:01:48.408 --> 00:01:52.344
that an asteroid the size
of a small house flew by Earth.

00:01:52.344 --> 00:01:53.679
And this is crazy --

00:01:53.679 --> 00:01:55.682
It got three offers on Zillow.

00:01:55.682 --> 00:01:56.682
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.682 --> 00:01:58.118
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

